<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - United Dominion reduced.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - United Dominion reduced.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it downgraded United Dominion Realty Trust Inc to market perform from outperform.</p>
<p>-- shares gained 1/8 to 13-5/8 in midmorning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
